The direct search found relevant diabetic-kidney literature, but the results shown so far include a type 1 diabetes biomarker study and experimental models—not clearly screen-detected type 2 diabetes. I’ll narrow the PubMed search to ADDITION and inspect the actual abstracts to determine whether there is direct cohort evidence.

